---
name: KAGAMI
tagline: Cosmic Funk from The Netherlands
shortBio: >-
  KAGAMI is a Netherlands-based Cosmic Funk duo. What began as a shared love for
  1980s Japanese City Pop and AOR has blossomed into an electronic project that
  embraces the pulse of French Touch, Italo Disco, and Brazilian MPB. Inspired
  by legendary acts like Daft Punk and Casiopea, their music blends live
  instrumentation with synth-centered production into a sound that is
  simultaneously nostalgic and forward-looking.
